## Exit Codes & Remedies

| Code | Meaning | Remedy |
|---|---|---|
| 0 | success | report the `data` result to the user |
| 2 | bad arguments | fix parameters and retry |
| 3 | business validation failed (e.g. `INVALID_STATE`, `AMOUNT_EXCEEDED`) | report the validation result honestly; **do not retry with tweaked parameters to bypass** |
| 4 | external dependency error | report the error code; suggest manual checks in the {{system name}} console |

